// Mounted combat (docs/specs/phase4/mounted-combat.md 3.2): the charge, unhorsing, the horse's nerves, refusal before braced polearms, footing.
// Integer units are in the names (pm permille, bp basis points, mmps mm/s, ticks 20 Hz). The spec's decimals are written here as integers:
// hold_per_riding 1.0 = 1000 pm, k_pct_per_m 0.8 = 80 bp per unit, max_pct 80 = 8000 bp, hook_mult 2.0 = 2000 pm.
